#: src/Modules/AdminPortal/Settings/SettingsSchema.php:295
msgid "Only the checked providers are tried, in the order shown, with the preferred provider moved to the front when it is checked. Unchecked providers are never used. With no provider checked, no exchange rate is fetched at all; converted prices keep using the rates already stored."
